"fi'o te kanpe li xokau".

There's also the attitudinals ju'o / ju'ocu'i / ju'onai for
certainty/possibility/impossibility
and la'a / la'acu'i / la'anai for more nuanced degrees of possibility
(plus all the ru'e/sai/cai variants).

